{"strings": [
{"key": "data.lesson.first_market.say.1", "text": "Compra con cabeza. Mucha variedad en un bar nuevo es dinero muerto de risa.", "src": "Buy narrow. A wide shelf on a new bar is just money standing still."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.0", "text": "Ocho botellas y un barril. Técnicamente, eso es un bar.", "src": "Eight bottles and a keg. That is a bar, technically."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.1", "text": "Léelos antes de servir — el carné dice a qué han venido.", "src": "Read them before you pour — the licence says what they came for."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.0", "text": "La caja no llega para el alquiler. A todo local le pasa una vez.", "src": "The till is under the rent. It happens to every room once."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.1", "text": "Dos veces es costumbre. Tres, y es otro bar con tu nombre en el letrero.", "src": "Twice is a habit. Three times is a different bar with your name on it."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.0", "text": "Dos destilados en una coctelera no se convierten solos en una bebida.", "src": "Two spirits in one tin do not become a drink on their own."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.1", "text": "Agítala o remuévela. El libro dice cuál.", "src": "Shake it or stir it. The book says which."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.0", "text": "La puerta está cerrada. Ponme una de lo que sí tengamos.", "src": "Door is shut. Pour me one of whatever we actually have."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.1", "text": "Primera noche al mando. En algún sitio es una norma.", "src": "Owner's first night. It is a rule somewhere."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.declined.0", "text": "Le estás diciendo que no a tu camarera. Qué valor.", "src": "You are turning down the bartender. Bold."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.nudge.0", "text": "Cualquier cosa de esa estantería. La difícil no soy yo.", "src": "Anything on that shelf. I am not the difficult one."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.0", "text": "No está mal para un local que la semana pasada no existía.", "src": "Not bad for a room that did not exist last week."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.1", "text": "Los que vengan después de mí te contarán los segundos. Yo no.", "src": "The ones who come after me will count your seconds. I do not."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_wrong.0", "text": "Eso no es lo que he pedido, y eso que yo soy la fácil.", "src": "That is not what I asked for, and I am the easy one."},
{"key": "hud.closed.banner", "text": "EL BAR HA CERRADO\ntres días perdiendo dinero — REINICIAR para volver a intentarlo", "src": "THE BAR IS CLOSED\nthree days losing money — NEW RUN to try again"},
